# Universal Profile UI (CARDBEY_PROFILE_UI_RULE_V1)

**Canonical doc:** `docs/CARDBEY_PROFILE_UI_RULE_V1.md`

Identity type (`creator` | `user` | `business` | future) must **never** determine public profile **layout**.

Use one Universal Profile UI (`UniversalProfileTheatreCanvas` / `PublicFeedShell`).

Type only drives: data, capabilities, modules, purpose.

Do **not** add CreatorProfileLayout / UserProfileLayout / BusinessProfileLayout shells.

Published storefront `/s/:slug` remains commerce resource UI; business identity uses Space/Universal Profile theatre.
